# These files are created by using the original kernels and simply renaming to .lustre
# They are not generated using the lustre kernels, they will be used as the ground truth against which the
# lustre kernels are tested
# The .lustre extention added to the original files is needed to trigger the distributed placement information of the kernels
# We want to check that the files created by the lustre kernels are the same as the ones created by the original kernels

A = readMatrix($A);

writeMatrix(A, $B);
writeMatrix(A, $C);
